{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>demo version of Storm Horse Simulator</strong>, you\u2019ll begin your adventure across 6 carefully crafted story quests that set the stage for the epic journey ahead. These missions not only introduce you to the vast world of Storm but also to the key characters who will accompany, challenge, or oppose you in the full game. Each one plays a crucial role in shaping your destiny as a wild stallion fighting for survival and freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/bda9879e982e2d5198554b71457c84c0.poster.avif?t=1759485298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/bda9879e982e2d5198554b71457c84c0.webm?t=1759485298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you finish the main questline, the adventure doesn\u2019t stop there. You\u2019ll be free to dive into side quests\u2014optional challenges designed to test your skills, reward your curiosity, and allow you to explore hidden corners of the world. Whether it\u2019s protecting weaker herd members, uncovering secrets of the land, or clashing with rival animals, every choice brings new layers of depth to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo also highlights the <strong>core gameplay mechanics</strong> that will remain central throughout the full experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vital Stats &amp; Herd Care</strong> \u2013 Balance your strength, stamina, hunger, and health while also watching over your herd\u2019s well-being.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong> \u2013 Survive encounters not just with humans seeking to capture or harm you, but also with dangerous wild predators testing your dominance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herd Protection</strong> \u2013 A scattered herd is a vulnerable herd. As their leader, it\u2019s up to you to keep them united, safe, and strong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.poster.avif?t=1759485298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.webm?t=1759485298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.mp4?t=1759485298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a preview\u2014it\u2019s your first step into a living, dangerous world where every decision matters. Will you rise as a fearless protector and lead your herd to safety, or falter and watch freedom slip away? The fate of the wild lies in your hooves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057570?t=1759485298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/dac5bf29105830f4ccab959ad4b65a8fc58646ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759485298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/0b537fee4542d6429fff00cdfe247b9298d35b84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759485298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/0b537fee4542d6429fff00cdfe247b9298d35b84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759485298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Contr