 herd\u2019s well-being.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong> \u2013 Survive encounters not just with humans seeking to capture or harm you, but also with dangerous wild predators testing your dominance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herd Protection</strong> \u2013 A scattered herd is a vulnerable herd. As their leader, it\u2019s up to you to keep them united, safe, and strong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.poster.avif?t=1759485298\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.webm?t=1759485298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/extras/1ffd9fa1ebfa7e6bccef8bad967c840f.mp4?t=1759485298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than a preview\u2014it\u2019s your first step into a living, dangerous world where every decision matters. Will you rise as a fearless protector and lead your herd to safety, or falter and watch freedom slip away? The fate of the wild lies in your hooves.</p>","developers":["INDIE FORGE STUDIOS S.R.L."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3826170","name":"Storm Horse Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057570/279682ac6dc67150f2b24faa71a8f7e49ee2e75c/header.jpg?t=1759485298","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057570/1766816