=1759485298"}],"short_description":"This is a DEMO version of Storm Horse Simulator! You are Storm, son of the legendary Amadeus. Now it\u2019s time to rescue your lost siblings across deserts, forests, and farms. Reunite the herd. Your journey begins here. Add Storm Horse Simulator to your Wishlist to be ready for the full adventure!","steam_appid":4057570,"support_info":{"email":"andrei.burlea@indieforgestudios.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":null}